  "body": "I would like to request support for sniffing \"test/csv\" and \"text/tab-separated-values\" types.\n\n[rfc4180](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4180) lays out the \"Common Format and MIME Type for Comma-Separated Values (CSV) Files\", and [rfc7111](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7111) updates it.\n\nA simple heuristic to check if the file is a csv or tsv is if it is already identified as text/plain, then count if the first few lines have the same number of commas (or tabs) on each line.\n",
